"entity": {
"name": "Sunoco LP",
"description": "Sunoco LP engages in the management and distribution of fuel products. It operates through the following segments: Fuel Distribution, Pipeline Systems, and Terminals. The Fuel Distribution segment includes one terminal, the Partnership\u2019s retail operations in Hawaii and New Jersey, credit card services and franchise royalties. The Pipeline Systems segment focuses on the integrated pipeline and terminal network comprised of approximately 6,000 miles of refined product pipeline. The Terminals segment operates four transmix processing facilities and 56 refined product terminals. The company was founded in 1886 and is headquartered in Dallas, TX.",
